--[[
    `figurine.scale` drives Custom Figurine `ImageScalar` at spawn time and spotlight bounds math at runtime.
    Every NPC's figurine and token URLs live in generated `lib/npc_art_urls.ttslua` (npm run npc-art:generate);
    `core/npc_spawn.ttslua` spawns figurines from it on demand.
    `werewolf = true`: every roll the Storyteller starts for this NPC is a Werewolf roll (Werewolf / Rage dice).
    Group "demoBand" exists for testing group spawn from the Storyteller NPC panel. ]]

